flowchart TD
    N1[Freeze criteria and review scope] --> N2[Assemble review bundle]
    N2 --> V1A[Blind validator accuracy lane]
    N2 --> V1B[Blind validator completeness and safety lane]
    V1A --> G1{Root gate combines verdicts fail closed}
    V1B --> G1
    G1 -->|both pass| T1[Return accept decision with evidence]
    G1 -->|revise| R1[Apply one bounded revision to named sections]
    R1 --> V2[Re-run failed validator lanes]
    V2 -->|pass| T1
    V2 -->|fail| X1[Stop with both verdicts and evidence]
